### Loan eligibility – happy paths
@mi = http://localhost:8290
@gw = https://localhost:8243/jamii
@base = {{mi}}/loans
# @base = {{gw}}/loans/v1
@apikey = paste-api-key

### Not eligible: 500,000 / 12 = 41,667 > 40% x 120,000 - 15,000 = 33,000 (expect 200, eligible=false)
POST {{base}}/eligibility
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}

{
  "customerId": "1",
  "monthlyIncome": 120000,
  "existingMonthlyDebt": 15000,
  "requestedAmount": 500000,
  "tenureMonths": 12
}

### Eligible: 300,000 / 12 = 25,000 <= 48,000 (expect 200, eligible=true)
POST {{base}}/eligibility
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}

{
  "customerId": "1",
  "monthlyIncome": 120000,
  "requestedAmount": 300000,
  "tenureMonths": 12
}

### Decimal amount and half-to-even rounding by the SOAP service (expect 200)
POST {{base}}/eligibility
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{apikey}}

{
  "customerId": "2",
  "monthlyIncome": 123457,
  "requestedAmount": 300000.49,
  "tenureMonths": 12
}
